; What lojix-bootstrap sends into the world: every process a bootstrap run
; starts, each one emission, and the outcome its translator observed. As in
; ethos/emission.ethos, a command line is a type: an emission names what is
; asked, and the translator, in src/bootstrap_translator.rs, is the one place
; that holds the words of the call, its program, argv and environment.
;
; A run evaluates and builds its closure on this machine, under the
; builders the request names; builds the hermetic check a boot-once plan
; carries; hashes each flake input it materialized from a Horizon
; definition; and roots the built closure below the run's own journal.
; A remote run copies the closure to its node unless the node holds it
; already, and reaches the node only through the private ssh configuration
; it wrote, under the identity the request names. A boot-once is a
; transient unit, scheduled on the node or on this machine, whose state is
; read by its name; its script is the translator's.
;
; A process that ends in failure is reported with its program, argv and
; how it ended; the bootstrap keeps that out of its terminal evidence.
Emission

[ signal_lojix:[ ClosurePath ]
  :crate:memory:[ PersistedFlakeInputOverride ]
  :crate:ingress:[ BootstrapFlakeReference BootstrapNixSystem BootstrapOutputSelector
                   BootstrapBuilderSpec BootstrapNixStoreUri ]
  :crate:emission:[ CallOutcome HashOutcome ProcessFailure UnitName ] ]

[ EvaluateBootstrapDerivation.BootstrapEvaluation
  BuildBootstrapDerivation.BootstrapBuild
  BuildBootstrapCheck.BootstrapCheckBuild
  HashGeneratedInput.GeneratedInputHashing
  RootBootstrapClosure.BootstrapRooting
  ReadRemoteClosure.RemoteClosureQuery
  CopyBootstrapClosure.BootstrapCopy
  ReadBootOnceUnit.BootOnceUnitQuery
  DispatchBootOnceUnit.BootOnceDispatch ]

[ BootstrapDerivationEvaluated.PrintedPathOutcome
  BootstrapDerivationBuilt.PrintedPathOutcome
  BootstrapCheckBuilt.CallOutcome
  GeneratedInputHashed.HashOutcome
  BootstrapClosureRooted.CallOutcome
  RemoteClosureRead.ClosurePresenceOutcome
  BootstrapClosureCopied.CallOutcome
  BootOnceUnitRead.BootOnceUnitOutcome
  BootOnceUnitDispatched.CallOutcome ]

[ BootstrapEvaluation.{ BootstrapNixSystem Vector<PersistedFlakeInputOverride>
                        BootstrapFlakeReference BootstrapOutputSelector }
  BootstrapBuild.{ BootstrapNixSystem Option<BootstrapBuilderSpec> DerivationPath }
  DerivationPath.String
  BootstrapCheckBuild.{ BootstrapNixSystem BootstrapFlakeReference BootstrapOutputSelector }
  GeneratedInputHashing.{ GeneratedInputDirectory.String }
  BootstrapRooting.{ RootStagingPath.String ClosurePath }
  RemoteClosureQuery.{ SshRoute ClosurePath }
  SshRoute.{ SshConfigPath SshIdentity }
  SshConfigPath.String
  SshIdentity.{ SshUser.String SshHost.String Option<SshPort> }
  SshPort.Integer
  BootstrapCopy.{ BootstrapNixStoreUri SshConfigPath ClosurePath }
  BootOnceUnitQuery.{ BootOnceRoute UnitName }
  BootOnceRoute.[ Remote.SshRoute Local ]
  BootOnceDispatch.{ BootOnceRoute BootOnceScript }
  BootOnceScript.{ UnitName ClosurePath SystemProfilePath.String BootEntriesDirectory.String }

  PrintedPathOutcome.[ Printed.PrintedStorePath Unprinted Failed.ProcessFailure ]
  PrintedStorePath.String
  ClosurePresenceOutcome.[ Present Absent Failed.ProcessFailure ]
  BootOnceUnitOutcome.[ Read.BootOnceUnitState Failed.ProcessFailure ]
  BootOnceUnitState.[ NotFound Ready Waiting Failed ] ]
